                                    expression="((count($FindCase/part1/ns10:Output/ns10:Find[ns10:Asset/statoAsset='CESSATO']))=1 or (count($FindCase/part1/ns10:Output/ns10:Find[ns10:Asset/statoAsset='CESSATO']))>1) and count($FindCase/part1/ns10:Output/ns10:Find[ns10:Asset/statoAsset=('ATTIVO','INLAVORAZIONE')])=0" expressionLanguage="urn:oasis:names:tc:wsbpel:2.0:sublang:xpath2.0"/>
